<title>USA: Flowers Industries Inc Q1 Sept 21 net rose.</title>
<headline>Flowers Industries Inc Q1 Sept 21 net rose.</headline>
<dateline>THOMASVILLE, Ga. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.35		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net			 19,948		    7,897</p>
<p> Revs		     322,710		  269,674</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  57,750		   57,133</p>
<p> Avg shrs diuted	 57,645		   57,182</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 net includes $43 million of pretax income from sale of distributor notes receivable. This resulted in pretax income for the quarter of $32.9 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
